    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MAS291 · Assessment 3/4</span>\n<h2>Progress Test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13136 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MAS291 · Đầu điểm 3/4</span>\n<h2>Progress Test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13136 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">30'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">All LOs</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: MC or a suitable format // OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">15</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Chapters introduced</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: by instructor, and by<br><br>suitable means (computer, paper, oral...)<br><br>OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Instruction and schedules for Progress tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>Test 1: LO1, LO2, LO3<br><br>Test 2: LO4, LO5, LO6<br><br>Test 3: LO7, LO8, LO9<br><br>OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal<br><br>Progress test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has resposibility to review the test for students after graded.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 18 — Progress Test 1</li><li>Session 34 — Progress Test 2</li><li>Session 60 — Progress Test 3</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 18 — Progress Test 1</li><li>Buổi 34 — Progress Test 2</li><li>Buổi 60 — Progress Test 3</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=MAS291\">Exam Room — MAS291</a> (48 papers: FE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=MAS291\">Phòng thi — MAS291</a> (48 đề: FE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
